terialTheme.colors.surface)\n .padding(vertical = 16.dp)\n )\n}\n\n/**\n * City chip - isolated and optimized with stable parameters\n */\n@Composable\nprivate fun CityChip(\n city: CityUiModel,\n isSelected: Boolean,\n onCitySelected: () -> Unit\n) {\n // Remember city properties to avoid recomposition\n val cityName = remember(city.id) { city.name }\n \n Chip(\n modifier = Modifier.fillMaxWidth(),\n onClick = onCitySelected,\n label = {\n Text(\n text = cityName,\n maxLines = 1,\n overflow = TextOverflow.Ellipsis\n )\n },\n colors = ChipDefaults.chipColors(\n backgroundColor = if (isSelected) {\n Color.Cyan.copy(alpha = 0.8f)\n } else {\n Color.Gray\n }\n )\n )\n}\n\n@WearPreviewDevices\n@Composable\nfun PreviewSettingsScreen() {\n // Preview removed - requires proper setup\n}\n"}"}}]},{"role":"tool","name":"write","tool_call_id":"toolu_019yPt6XsZcFynY3LYZbcV9g","content":"Wrote contents to /Users/hazemafaneh/StudioProjects/prayer/JordanPrayerTimes/app/src/main/java/com/mbf/wearable/jordanprayertimes/presentation/screens/Settings.kt.

