✅ **Centered Display**: Progress bar is perfectly centered on screen 
✅ **Automatic Show/Hide**: Based on `uiState.isLoading` from ViewModel 
✅ **Non-blocking UI**: Content remains visible behind the overlay 
✅ **Smooth Transitions**: Compose handles the appearance/disappearance smoothly 
✅ **Optimized Performance**: Memoized values prevent unnecessary recompositions

